fact WorkItem(id: "WI-203", description: some(value: "WorkItemStore spec + FileBasedWorkitemStore impl (proposal 036 phase 2). Builds on WI-202 (IndexedFileStore + QueryableStore foundation). New project-side file 'anthill-todo/store.anthill' declaring: (a) the abstract spec — 'sort WorkItemStore { sort State = ?  operation next_id(s: Cell[State]) -> String effects Modify[s]; operation commit(s: Cell[State], w: WorkItem) -> Unit effects {Modify[s], Error}; operation forget(s: Cell[State], id: String) -> Unit effects {Modify[s], Error}; operation lookup(s: Cell[State], id: String) -> Option[WorkItem]; operation by_status_of(s: Cell[State], st: WorkStatus) -> List[WorkItem] }'. Operations declared once, parameterized by State. (b) the file-backed impl — 'sort FileBasedWorkitemStore { enum WIS { entity wis(backend: IndexedFileStore, id_counter: Int) end }  fact WorkItemStore[WIS]  operation commit(s, w) = ...  operation lookup(s, id) = Stream.first(retrieve(backend, WorkItem(id: id)))  operation by_status_of(s, st) = Stream.collect(retrieve(backend, WorkItem(status: st)))  ... }'. Impl-side bodies use Cell.get/Cell.set on s and route lookups through QueryableStore.retrieve from WI-202. (c) host plumbing in 'rustland/anthill-todo/src/main.rs' (run_anthill_bundle) — scan facts_of(\"WorkItem\") for the max existing id, build 'wis(backend, max_id + 1)', allocate Cell[WIS], seed via Cell.set once before Main.main runs. Pass the cell handle to Main.main as the WorkItemStore parameter. (d) smoke tests for the spec/impl interaction — typer accepts 'requires WorkItemStore[?S]' clauses; spec-instance bodies (anthill-source 'operation foo(args) = body' under a fact in an impl sort) load and dispatch via the fact. If the typer doesn't yet support these, file follow-ups; phase 2 may need typer extensions before it lands. Acceptance: cargo test green; new store.anthill loads alongside domain.anthill / rules.anthill via the existing BulkStore::pull path; host correctly seeds the cell handle and Main.main receives it. Independent of phase 3 — phase 2 lands the spec/impl/host plumbing without touching the bundle command bodies. Out of scope: WI-189 (reflect operators) — phase 2 retrieve results are Term values until WI-189 lands; cmd_X bodies (phase 3); bundle refactor."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-202"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-05-09T21:39:00Z"))

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-203", author: "user", content: "Reordered: WI-203 should land AFTER WI-205 (Modify framework runtime: per-resource handlers + Cell sort). Original WI-203 description assumed v0.1 transitional functor-keyed scheme would suffice; per design feedback the fundamentals must be in place first. Effective dependency: WI-203 depends on WI-202 (IndexedFileStore retrieve, landed in commit 4c08e87) and WI-205 (Modify framework runtime, not yet started).", at: "2026-05-08T10:36:03Z")
